From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Codex <codex@openai.com>
Date: Sat, 5 Sep 2026 00:30:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 24/24] media: meson: accept exact Meson8b microcode size

The pinned Hardkernel Meson8b dblk microcode contains 2384 words, or 9536
bytes. Match the driver minimum-size check to that exact firmware payload.

Signed-off-by: Codex <codex@openai.com>
---
 drivers/media/platform/amlogic/meson-venc/meson-venc.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/drivers/media/platform/amlogic/meson-venc/meson-venc.c b/drivers/media/platform/amlogic/meson-venc/meson-venc.c
index 11fce7e..f54399e 100644
--- a/drivers/media/platform/amlogic/meson-venc/meson-venc.c
+++ b/drivers/media/platform/amlogic/meson-venc/meson-venc.c
@@ -322,7 +322,7 @@ static void meson_venc_trace_stage(struct meson_venc_dev *venc,
 static const struct meson_venc_variant meson_venc_meson8b_variant = {
 	.name = "meson8b",
 	.firmware = "meson/venc/meson8b_h264.bin",
-	.firmware_min_size = 2400 * sizeof(u32),
+	.firmware_min_size = 2384 * sizeof(u32),
 	.clock_rate = 319000000UL,
 	.ao_sleep_reg = 0x08,
 	.ao_iso_reg = 0x0c,
-- 
2.51.0
